message: "如果在教学或研究中使用了本项目，请按以下信息引用。If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "私人智能教练 Pose Fitness Coach：姿态识别 + 规则引擎的课堂演示"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gao"
    given-names: "Shuyao"
    email: "gaoshuyao.mk@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "aSSIST University (Seoul School of Integrated Sciences and Technologies)"
version: "1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/pose-fitness-coach"
url: "https://shuyaogao.github.io/pose-fitness-coach/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo for the AI Teaching Demos series. A pretrained pose
  network (MediaPipe Pose Landmarker) turns camera frames into 33 body keypoints; a
  hand-written, inspectable rule engine (joint angles plus a hysteresis state machine)
  counts squats and jumping jacks and explains every verdict. Works offline by
  double-clicking play/index.html; ships with procedurally generated skeleton clips so
  it can be explored without a camera.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - pose-estimation
  - mediapipe
  - fitness
  - rule-based-system
